            "maxLength": 1024,
            "x-example": "******"
          },
          {
            "name": "project_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n\n租户在某一Region下的project ID。\n\n获取方法请参见[获取项目ID](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-ddm/ddm_api_01_0063.html)。\n\n**约束限制**:\n\n不涉及。\n\n**取值范围**:\n\n只能由英文字母、数字组成,且长度为32个字符。\n\n**默认取值**:\n\n不涉及。\n",
            "required": true,
            "minLength": 0,
            "maxLength": 1024,
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "619d3e78f61b4be68bc5aa0b59edcf7b"
